            </p>
          </article>

          <article
            class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border border-solid border-[#0F172A] bg-[#0F172A] p-7 shadow-[0_24px_70px_rgba(15,23,42,0.20)] transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_34px_90px_rgba(15,23,42,0.26)] sm:p-8 lg:p-9"
          >
            <div
              class="absolute top-0 right-0 h-40 w-40 translate-x-12 -translate-y-12 rounded-full bg-primary-500/20"
            >
            </div>
            <div
